lex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:10pt;min-width:6.667%;text-align:justify;"><span style="transform:scale(0.67);color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:super;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;transform-origin:top left;font-kerning:none;min-width:6.667%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(2)</span><div style="display:inline;"><ix:footnote id="FNT_a0d01f26-dede-4e0f-b40b-b56b8204bfdc" xml:lang="en-US"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">In prior periods the United States and Latin America were reported as separate segments. Due to the reduction of the United States operating segment, the Company&#8217;s United States operations are no longer analyzed by the chief operating decision maker on a standalone basis but rather as part of the Americas segment. As a result, for purposes of segment reporting United States operations are now consolidated with Latin America operations and reported as a consolidated segment, and prior period information has been conformed to the new consolidated reporting segment.</span></ix:footnote></div></div></ix:continuation></div></ix:continuation></div></div>
