analyzed by the chief operating decision maker on a standalone basis but rather as part of the Americas segment. As a result, for purposes of segment reporting United States operations are now consolidated with Latin America operations and reported as a consolidated segment, and prior period information has been conformed to the new consolidated reporting segment.</span></div></div></div>
